<title>USA: Adelphia completes $200 mln note exchange.</title>
<headline>Adelphia completes $200 mln note exchange.</headline>
<dateline>COUDERSPORT, Pa. 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Adelphia Communications Corp said Wednesday that it has completed its exchange offer of $200 million of senior notes.</p>
<p>The exchange was completed by the company's nonconsolidated joint venture limited partnership, Olympus Communications LP. It exchanged $200 million in new 10-5/8 percent senior notes due 2006, series B, for the outstanding 10-5/8 percent senior notes due 2006, series A.</p>
<p>The exchange offer expired at 1700 EDT/2100 GMT on Friday, June 6.</p>
